---
const flags = [
  'You are currently navigating addiction in any form <em>(the retreat is alcohol- and substance-free for the full three days)</em>',
  'You are currently taking state-altering medication',
  'You are arriving from, or moving through, an especially activated moment in your life — a sudden loss, a raw and recent trauma, an episode of severe destabilisation',
  'You are carrying unresolved, older trauma that may destabilise you when activated in a group setting, and might be better held by a therapeutic professional in a 1:1 context',
];
---

<section class="rb-framework">
  <div class="rb-framework-inner">
    <div class="rb-framework-head">
      <div class="rb-eyebrow rb-eyebrow--center">Our framework for this circle</div>
      <h2 class="rb-h2">A circle worth <em>protecting</em></h2>
    </div>

    <p class="rb-framework-body">
      This retreat is a space for somatic regulation, for being met, and
      for the quiet work of returning to yourself in a held circle. The
      integrity of that circle is a shared responsibility — and we want
      it to truly serve you and the group as a whole.
    </p>

    <p class="rb-framework-body">
      If any of the following applies to you, please reach out to us
      before registering so we can talk it through:
    </p>

    <ul class="rb-framework-list">
      {flags.map((flag) => (
        <li><span set:html={flag} /></li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <p class="rb-framework-foot">
      We would rather have an honest conversation upfront than discover a
      mismatch on the first evening — so please write to us if anything
      here raises a question.
    </p>

    <div class="rb-cta-wrap">
      <a
        href="mailto:info@songdance.co"
        class="rb-btn"
        aria-label="Email info@songdance.co"
      >
        Write to us <i class="ph-light ph-envelope-simple"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
